      "message": "I\u0027ve tested the performance of the `timer_dos` test and here are my results averaged over 3 runs (running on i7-9700):\n\n`Renode 1.15.1_p20240714`:\n`bloonchipper`: 6.97s\n`buccaneer`: 6.50s\n`dartmonkey`: 17.94s\n`helipilot`: 6.50s\n\n`Renode 1.15.3_p20241010`:\n`bloonchipper`: 7.00s\n`buccaneer`: 6.50s\n`dartmonkey`: 24.02s\n`helipilot`: 6.50s\n\nSo for the `timer_dos` only `dartmonkey` is noticeably slower, but in all cases the test finished successfully after adjusting the timeout. I\u0027ve also increased the timeout for the `timer_dos` test, could you verify on your end if everything now works as expected?",
